##club checks:

### Create a new club
### This request creates a new book club in the database.
### It requires a logged-in user, so we must send an access token.
### The server will take the logged-in user from the token and save them as:
### 1. creator - the user who created the club
### 2. first member - the creator is automatically added to members

POST http://localhost:5000/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTI1NDgwM2Q3OTdmZTRiOWNiZDQyNjEiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODEwMDU0MTQsImV4cCI6MTc4MTAwNjMxNH0.GEr9SoA4ami3evjix9UhW8YjrurAgp9nzZ02ZPG62oE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fantasy Readers",
  "description": "A cozy club for fantasy book lovers",
  "genres": ["Fantasy"]
}
### Create a new club as second user
### This request creates a new book club using Noa's account.
### Because the token belongs to Noa, the server will save Noa as:
### 1. the creator of the club
### 2. the first member of the club
POST http://localhost:5000/api/clubs
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI2YTI4MDQ4NmIzYzA5ZDAwNWExYjZmMTciLCJpYXQiOjE3ODEwMDc0OTQsImV4cCI6MTc4MTAwODM5NH0.7Ub50Pct_1bqW319m4bg08gwYEF8RbtiiQ8kA8PGOt0
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mystery & Tea Club",
  "description": "A relaxed club for readers who love mysteries, thrillers, and cozy discussions.",
  "genres": ["Mystery", "Thriller"]
}
### Get all public clubs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clubs

### Search clubs by club name
### This request searches public clubs by club name.
### It can return more than one club if several clubs match the same text.
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clubs?search=fantasy

### Filter clubs by genre
### This request returns public clubs that include the selected genre.
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clubs?genre=Fantasy

### Search clubs by creator name
### This request returns public clubs created by users whose name includes the search text.
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clubs?creator=maya

### Search clubs by name and genre together
### This request returns public clubs whose name includes the search text
### and whose genres include the selected genre.
GET http://localhost:5000/api/clubs?search=fantasy&genre=Fantasy